    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d216">

                <pb facs="0429" n="415" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg415"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EAC/12–544: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-12-05T20:00:00+01:00">December 5, 1944—8
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>10752. Comea 133. Strang today notified me officially that United Kingdom
                    Government approve (1) text of agreement and covering report on Control
                    Machinery in Germany of November 14 and (2) text of the protocol on Zones of
                    Occupation in Germany of September 12, as modified and completed by the
                    agreement of November 14 on amendments to the Protocol on Zones (Embassy’s 9972
                    November 14, 10 p.m.;<anchor n="88" xml:id="d216-f1"/> originals transmitted in
                    Embassy’s despatches 19196 and 19215 of November 14),<anchor n="89"
                        xml:id="d216-f2"/> as submitted by the European Advisory Commission to the
                    three Governments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d216-f1" n="88" xml:id="d216-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it reported the signing of the above-mentioned agreements (740.00119
                    EAC/11–1444).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d216-f2" n="89" xml:id="d216-f2-content">
                <p>Neither despatch printed; for citation to the agreements, see bracketed notes,
                        <ref target="#pg334">pp. 334</ref> and <ref target="#pg404">404</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
